Package: writing-desk
Version: __VERSION__
Section: web
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: nodejs (>= 22)
Maintainer: Writing Desk ops <ops@writing-desk.example>
Description: Writing Desk writer app + git orchestrator (writer-app M4d)
 Thin hosted writing surface (editor + review overlay + chat conductor)
 with the host-side git orchestrator, packaged per ADR-0001: immutable
 versioned artifact, dpkg as the idempotency engine, rollback = install
 the previous version. Code lives under /opt/writing-desk (dpkg-owned);
 state lives under /srv/writer-app and is never touched by the package.
